---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Design lineage
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The architecture and the audio-pipeline design of this project were informed
by the music player subsystem of the VCPChat project
(https://github.com/lioensky/VCPChat), in particular:

  - the three-layer split of audio engine / player / lyric stage;
  - the idea that playback state must have a single authoritative source;
  - the HTTP + WebSocket protocol shape of the audio service.

No source file of that project is copied into this repository. All code here
is an independent implementation written for this project.
